Screenshot placeholders created.

To add real screenshots:
1. Run the app on device/emulator
2. Navigate to each screen
3. Capture using: adb shell screencap -p /sdcard/screenshot.png
4. Pull using: adb pull /sdcard/screenshot.png screenshots/[name].png

Required screenshots (200x400px recommended):
- home.png
- create_trip.png
- trip_detail.png
- ai_enrichment.png
- suggestions.png
- settings.png
- year_planner.png
- budget_tracking.png
